BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Footsteps Around the Fort - Fort York Neighbourhood Tours
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260501T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260607T110000
UID:62629bc9cb171f4d98274357b49eff34@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Discover the hidden gems and iconic landmarks of the CityPlace
  Fort York neighbourhood. This guided tour gives you a new perspective on 
 the evolving landscape of this community. Discover how historic landscapes
  continue to shape Toronto today as stories come to life through storytell
 ing and conversation along the route. Come dressed for the weather. Perfec
 t for families and dog-friendly\, all ages are welcome to learn\, explore 
 and experience the neighbourhood together. The tour route covers about 2 k
 m over paved pathways and includes major intersections.
LOCATION:Tours run at 11 a.m. and 2 p.m. from Canoe Landing Park\, Bobber 
 Plaza
URL:https://secure.toronto.ca/webapps/feps_edc-ticketing/#events/27e98ff0-
 5b8d-47ae-8835-d6d496fe6393
