DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260506T190000
UID:d6daf389fe9ae8492c6b0c9a1ca4de58@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Juno Award-winning Canadian opera star Jane Archibald performs
  a romantic program of intimate works by Johannes Brahms\, Clara Schumann 
 and Robert Schumann.
