DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260514T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260514T120000
UID:e4dc1df7716a489ec69d43160bf103b5@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Take in an engaging webinar with renowned local nature photogr
 apher James Beaton. This session showcases photographs and field stories t
 hat reveal the rich biodiversity woven throughout our urban landscape. Lea
 rn practical\, ethical ways to observe and respect wildlife while still ca
 pturing meaningful images.
LOCATION:On-line Event
