DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260611T100000
UID:ce06ab30826aafcde3a01fb15b046db9@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:Experience natural scenes transformed into unique artistic int
 erpretations using various techniques in camera and post processing in thi
 s group photography exhibition by F8 Photography Collective. This exhibiti
 on will be part of CONTACT Photography Festival 2026.
