DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260523T000000
UID:61c3e7e3458ee4f912083ca2a17c8b6f@toronto.ca
DESCRIPTION:A dynamic gathering that brings together climate advocates\, y
 outh leaders\, innovators\, creatives\, and community organizers from acro
 ss the world. This event exists to amplify global voices\, strengthen cros
 s-border collaboration and push forward bold ideas that advance environmen
 tal equity and climate action.
